            "reviewBody": "I cut the recipe in half and added 1/2 cup of natural pb. I actually set them in the fridge for 2 hours, and they were ready to go! I took them into work and people couldn't get enough! I had more people asking for this recipe than anything else I've baked and brought into the office.",
